nstance  once your free trial instance is running  you can get started exploring spanner  we provide a walkthrough for setting up  a sample finance database using either  the default google sql dialect or the  new postgresql dialect  spanner gives you the flexibility to use  ansi compliant google sql or a  postgresql interface that supports the  popular postgresql engine  allowing you to use existing skills and  expertise to manage your data you can  also bring your own schema and test how  it will work on spanner  to get started with an example finance  database simply click the learn button  in the console  this will open up instructions to get  the sample database and workload running  using cloud shell  the init command will download the  required binaries and create the  database  the first tutorial is about exploring  the schema that is created within cloud  console  the second tutorial then allows you to  run a workload against the database that  was created  then you can run queries on the data  that was generated  it has never been easier to try out  cloud spanner  with the free trial you have 90 days to  try out spanner at no cost using a free  instance you can even build a fully free  application on google cloud by using  cloud spanner free trial along with the  free tier offered by other products such  as compute engine or bigquery  you can upgrade your free trial instance  to a paid instance at any time without  any downtime  then you can continue with your proof of  concept of building your application  with the full benefits that spanner  provides such as scaling and  multi-regional configurations  so go ahead and create a cloud spanner  free trial instance today  [Music]  you

